    - pick R=3, C=3-4, N=5-7
    - assign 2+R+C distinct colors for bg, border, mask, R labels, C swatches
    - for each column, generate a random binary mask on (N-2)x(N-2) with 30-70% fill; ensure distinct masks across columns
    - for each column, pick which row (0..R-1) holds the solid swatch
    - build output panels from mask+swatch+label
    - build input by placing panels in R x C grid; for non-solid slots replicate the mask in mask-color on bg; for the solid slot fill interior with swatch color; frame all panels with border color; add bg separator rows/cols and leftmost label column
